      <activity id="99c19535-aedb-5987-ad1c-c6c63a46bfcd" activityNameId="fa5aa952-3bed-5c43-aa99-cf15d06ad7e2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, from planing, hard, air, kiln dried, u=10%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, from planing, hard, air, kiln dried, u=10%, at plant
The multi-output process "planing, hardwood, air / kiln dried, u=10%" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, hardwood, planed, air / kiln dried, u=10%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, from planing, hard, air/kiln dried, u=10%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: b4ed1582-325b-3f9d-a35c-460b78218ed6
Includes planing process. planing mill is assumed to be located on the sawmill site. No transports are considered. Dust emissions are neglected for a lack of data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany (1986)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the German technology mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b4ed1582-325b-3f9d-a35c-460b78218ed6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
